商业思维、做轻量副业的人。", "downloads": 0, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_c60533b9/11", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/a00e31c7-8d6a-4e65-84fc-16a177f95674.png", "installs": 0, "isServiceized": false, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "漳州卫生职业学院-校园二手物品倒卖skill", "namespace": null, "ownerName": "user_c60533b9", "score": 0, "slug": "11", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "subCategories": [{"key": "biz-ecommerce", "name": "电商运营"}, {"key": "biz-project-management", "name": "项目管理"}], "tags": null, "updated_at": 1786876547366, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "professional", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1786274329352, "description": "This skill should be used when the user wants a deep-dive analysis of a single A-share stock — answering \"why did this stock move, what story is the market pricing in, where does it sit in the value chain, and how does it compare to the true core peers,\" plus a full-dimensional read (technical + capital flow + fundamentals + narrative logic). Trigger on phrases like \"诊断 XX\", \"深挖 XX\", \"XX 今天为什么涨\", \"XX 炒什么逻辑\", \"XX 逻辑拆解\", \"XX 和 XX 比谁更正宗\". Internal detailed mode only (names the stock, gives key levels) — no public/desensitized variant. All conclusions must be grounded in real data pulled from tdx / westock-data / neodata — never from memory. Output is twofold: a natural-language diagnostic report AND an ECharts HTML dashboard (real K-line candlestick, capital-flow bars, revaluation radar, peer-comparison bars, chain-value bars, evidence-audit tags) generated by render_report.py.", "description_zh": "对单只A股做深度诊断——回答\"为什么涨、市场在price什么故事、处于产业链哪环、与正宗核心同业比如何\"，覆盖技术面+资金流+基本面+叙事逻辑。内部研究版（点名个股、给关键价位）。所有结论必须基于 tdx/westock/neodata 真实数据，禁凭记忆编造。输出自然语言诊断报告 + ECharts HTML 看板（真实K线/资金流/重估雷达/同业对比/产业链价值/证据审计）。", "downloads": 0, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_913f118d/stock-deep-diagnosis", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/f7fabcfa-0496-4dc7-9258-df9b7c751850.png", "installs": 0, "isServiceized": false, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "个股深度诊断", "namespace": null, "ownerName": "user_913f118d", "score": 0, "slug": "stock-deep-diagnosis", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "subCategories": [{"key": "pro-finance", "name": "金融分析"}], "tags": null, "updated_at": 1786280868096, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.3"}]}